@CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY = clave-de-control-plane

### Listar usuarios (sin filtros)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY}}

### Filtrar por status (valores válidos: ACTIVE, SUSPENDED, DELETED)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users?status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY}}

### Buscar por clerkId, buyerName o sellerName
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users?q=Paola
Authorization: Bearer {{CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY}}

### Suspender usuario
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users/REEMPLAZAR_CON_CLERK_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "SUSPENDED" }

### Activar usuario
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users/REEMPLAZAR_CON_CLERK_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ACTIVE" }

### Eliminar usuario
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users/REEMPLAZAR_CON_CLERK_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "DELETED" }
